{"v":4,"catch":"用蠟筆為美味的食物上色吧！\n親手完成甜點與料理。\n以真實的蠟筆質感創作屬於你的美食藝術！","desc":"《蠟筆美食》是繼《蠟筆汽車》、《蠟筆恐龍》、《蠟筆萬聖節》之後推出的全新系列。\n這次，美味的食物世界在色彩中展開！\n紙杯蛋糕、比薩、紫菜飯捲、冰淇淋等多樣料理，讓你自由上色表現創意。\n無論是一個人靜靜塗色，或與家人朋友共度歡樂時光，都充滿樂趣。\n收集完成的食物插畫，打造你的專屬色彩食譜！]","publisher":"GaniTani","release":"2025-11-13","genres":["學習","訓練","街機","實用"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9c906c158b4f9b2bd618baf1da71a0ea1c8e629a4309c7522d6a011d6cb9f408.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f96d1058337ecfdafe2d75dee10a01cad76c59d6e989de7fcfc5da96a8840188.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d0adef3d8e6916071076ade9a570183ca4a4ced58226d48eb0a104388ed91458.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/15c450d252f560640aa76af6d482ae4472e4e5ed7d6a2b98d35e11e5361e7d7a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/80e6ef3f0d698e1d3f7e58be8b873000689b6d133d58db4c17cc638e75bc3724.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9c5879ff080dfd7e5e48bd857b1d9134000aba5fc2e7a0c3de7126783d01ff24.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ce502583e000","dlc":[]}